    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d798">

                <pb facs="0761" n="645" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg645"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/14224.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Vice Consul Silliman to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams—Extracts.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mexico City</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-01-17">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 17, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Last night the Convention formally deposed the Provisional President and itself
                    assumed the Government. The President of the Convention was named the Executive
                    of the Convention.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Silliman.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
